WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:03.770
- But about maybe five days ago,
I realized I'm coming to Denver

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:04.871
to interview the wrong person.

00:00:04.871 --> 00:00:07.140
I should be interviewing your mascot,
- Rocky?

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:12.078
- who we all learned apparently is making,
like, $600,000 a year.

00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:13.513
Did you see that report?
- Oh, yeah, yeah.

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:18.118
- So what makes Rocky
the superior NBA mascot?

00:00:18.118 --> 00:00:19.052
- He just gives off a lot of energy

00:00:19.052 --> 00:00:21.488
and makes the half-court shots backwards
every time.

00:00:22.222 --> 00:00:24.124
Actually at a really good rate.

00:00:24.991 --> 00:00:25.492
And, yeah.

00:00:25.492 --> 00:00:27.027
Yeah. He just does a great job. Great energy.

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:31.664
- So do you know the man or woman
inside of Rocky?

00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:32.665
- Mmhmm.
- OK.

00:00:32.665 --> 00:00:34.934
What's he or she like?

00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:36.770
- Uh, that's confidential.

00:00:36.770 --> 00:00:39.239
- Really? Is this top-secret?
- Yeah. That's how it goes.

00:00:39.239 --> 00:00:40.807
- Is the identity not revealed?

00:00:40.807 --> 00:00:42.142
- Nah.
- Does anyone know Rocky?

